      "side": 1,
      "message": "For context, the NOT_VCN_MANAGED bit was originally planned to be a default capability but was instead moved to be a non-default capability that transports are supposed to manually add themselves. Based on this, we currently only remove the NOT_VCN_MANAGED bit in VcnManagementService. We can technically fix this by setting the bit as needed, but the change here best follows our compromise with Core Networking.\n\nManually adding the NOT_VCN_MANAGED bit also reflects the previous approach (before checking VCN network policies was added)\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/opt/telephony/+/1540585/11/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/dataconnection/DataConnection.java\n\n\nAlso it looks like NetworkCapabilities.Builder does not provide a setCapability() method\nhttp://cs/android/frameworks/base/packages/Connectivity/framework/src/android/net/NetworkCapabilities.java?l\u003d2316\u0026rcl\u003d38f7ae7afad69cfe86f5bc29f1c283c097224796",
